{"about_the_game":"Crapht Box is a <strong>Fantasy Physics Sandbox</strong>. You can craft your machineries with a variety of elements; program your own disks; and edit your scene with built-in tools.<br><br>Crapht Box offers necessary physics elements for framework of your machine construction, sensors/dynamics for input/output, and chips for circuit logic. Programming skill is not required, but you can use the beginner-friendly Wren or Lua language to write something as you like.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Specs.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Display: scalable from 640x480<br></li><li>Audio: 2 music channels, 4 sound effect channels, 1 speech channel<br></li><li>Circuit clock: 60Hz<br></li><li>Code: Wren, Lua<br></li><li>Gamepad: 6 buttons (D-Pad + A/B)<br></li><li>Keyboard and mouse: supported</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/442a6d04a9adff6048eaef6339300680.poster.avif?t=1754382829\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/442a6d04a9adff6048eaef6339300680.webm?t=1754382829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/a2ecb9d9eb2d476f74b2f0ef72640ec7.poster.avif?t=1754382829\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/a2ecb9d9eb2d476f74b2f0ef72640ec7.webm?t=1754382829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/2f0ac02aa10c1d56825419c4df792830.poster.avif?t=1754382829\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/2f0ac02aa10c1d56825419c4df792830.webm?t=1754382829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/2f0ac02aa10c1d56825419c4df792830.mp4?t=1754382829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/483f6b2e78e37c05e77f98dd23377c29.poster.avif?t=1754382829\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/483f6b2e78e37c05e77f98dd23377c29.webm?t=1754382829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/483f6b2e78e37c05e77f98dd23377c29.mp4?t=1754382829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Craft your machineries with physics, chip, sensor and dynamics elements.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Programming</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/88f23ad73f3c8d432d91cd8e910c435e.avif?t=1754382829\" width=640 height=480 /></span><br><br>Program your own disks.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Creating</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/91c74a35499c1f6e49f9023ca1679da4.poster.avif?t=1754382829\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/91c74a35499c1f6e49f9023ca1679da4.webm?t=1754382829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/91c74a35499c1f6e49f9023ca1679da4.mp4?t=1754382829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Edit your scene with built-in tools.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sharing</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/11b97e92f3b64ab9a89347efed299825.avif?t=1754382829\" width=640 height=480 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/d277d7735263c8016636999545222ffb.poster.avif?t=1754382829\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/d277d7735263c8016636999545222ffb.webm?t=1754382829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/d277d7735263c8016636999545222ffb.mp4?t=1754382829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Share your creativity with others.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1227090?t=1754382829","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1227090?t=1754382829","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754382829","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754382829","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Sharing</h1><p>Share your creative disks via Workshop using built-in tools, and play others' creations.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Crapht Box is a <strong>Fantasy Physics Sandbox</strong>. You can craft your machineries with a variety of elements; program your own disks; and edit your scene with built-in tools.<br><br>Crapht Box offers necessary physics elements for framework of your machine construction, sensors/dynamics for input/output, and chips for circuit logic. Programming skill is not required, but you can use the beginner-friendly Wren or Lua language to write something as you like.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Specs.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Display: scalable from 640x480<br></li><li>Audio: 2 music channels, 4 sound effect channels, 1 speech channel<br></li><li>Circuit clock: 60Hz<br></li><li>Code: Wren, Lua<br></li><li>Gamepad: 6 buttons (D-Pad + A/B)<br></li><li>Keyboard and mouse: supported</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/442a6d04a9adff6048eaef6339300680.poster.avif?t=1754382829\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/442a6d04a9adff6048eaef6339300680.webm?t=1754382829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/a2ecb9d9eb2d476f74b2f0ef72640ec7.poster.avif?t=1754382829\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/a2ecb9d9eb2d476f74b2f0ef72640ec7.webm?t=1754382829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/2f0ac02aa10c1d56825419c4df792830.poster.avif?t=1754382829\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/2f0ac